import BstLean.Part160Sc

/-!
# Part 160 (file `ScTab`): the centre energy as a function of the lower end of the window

Do not use `sorry`, `native_decide` or `axiom`.

* `Tcos_window_gen`, `sO2_ge_gen`, `ebO16_sharp_gen`, `eb16_sharp_gen`: the bounds of
  `Part160ScEv` and `Part160Sc` with a free lower end `θlo ≤ θ_in ≤ 0.55` and free numbers.
* `eb16_sharp_46`, …, `eb16_sharp_54`: `t_A|b|² ≤ γ_A·Eb_k` on `GoodC16` and `SSc` for
  `k/100 ≤ θ_in ≤ 0.55` (the numeric instances are generated by a script).
-/

namespace BstLean.Part160

